### Peticiones para la extensión REST Client de VS Code (o el cliente HTTP de JetBrains).
### Haz clic en "Send Request" sobre cada una.

@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/credit-cards
@userId = 8f6d3c1e-2a4b-4c5d-9e8f-0a1b2c3d4e01

### Crear tarjeta -> 201
# @name created
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "{{userId}}", "cardNumber": "4111 1111 1111 1111", "expiry": "12/29", "cvv": "123", "creditLimit": 5000 }

### Listar activas -> 200
GET {{base}}

### Obtener por id -> 200
GET {{base}}/{{created.response.body.id}}

### Actualizar -> 200
PATCH {{base}}/{{created.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "creditLimit": 7500.25, "status": "BLOCKED" }

### Eliminar (soft delete) -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/{{created.response.body.id}}

### Falta creditLimit -> 400
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "{{userId}}", "cardNumber": "4111111111111111", "expiry": "12/29", "cvv": "123" }

### Validar sin guardar: muestra cada regla incumplida
POST {{base}}/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cardNumber": "3782822463100051", "expiry": "01/24", "cvv": "12a" }
